    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6cc6ef422b8726c45b55b885412734f7, type: 3}
    sentence: So, Lynn. Before we lose ourselves in nerdy talk again I want to ask-
      Why did you come here?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Lynn
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62eaae04548671943969da195ad840fd, type: 3}
    sentence: Oh, well.. I thought you and I.. we kind of connected you know and-
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Io
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 01e1aff972284664e96e9b5d30ca1b74, type: 3}
    sentence: "Oh haha, I guess I should\u2019ve been clearer. I meant like, what
      led you to signing up for these dates?"
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Lynn
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Oh uh.. Well to be honest, ever since my most recent break up I haven\u2019t
      really been able to connect with anyone. I thought going to uni would help
      but it just made things worse."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Io
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6cc6ef422b8726c45b55b885412734f7, type: 3}
    sentence: "I hear you. I\u2019ve never been a natural at these things either."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Lynn
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dc6dc528b1ca174c8f9f2f96dd29415, type: 3}
    sentence: "What- really? But you\u2019re like gorgeous and as much as I\u2019ve
      seen, very talented at flirting."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Io
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: 
    eventTrigger: 
    choices:
    - choices: "It\u2019s standard but I really want to get to know you better."
